sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant Intake as Intake
    participant Router as Router
    participant Retriever as Retriever
    participant QD as Qdrant
    participant OAI as OpenRouter

    User->>API: POST /query
    API->>Intake: analyze(query)
    Note over Intake: LLM triage produces CaseContext<br/>Paralegal regex override

    Intake->>Router: CaseContext
    Note over Router: Regex corpus routing<br/>Entity extraction<br/>Query rewriting

    Router->>Retriever: QueryPlan
    Retriever->>OAI: Embed query
    OAI-->>Retriever: 1536-dimension vector

    Retriever->>QD: Search(vector, limit=15, optional filter)
    QD-->>Retriever: 15 candidate passages

    Note over Retriever: Fallback if 0 results<br/>Entity reranking<br/>Adaptive filtering<br/>Composite confidence
